{"seq":3,"slug":"intelligent-bioprocess-control","title":"智能生物过程控制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment/intelligent-bioprocess-control","wordCount":1698,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"智能生物过程控制\">智能生物过程控制</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>传统生物过程依赖操作员经验与固定程序运行，面对微生物代谢的非线性、时变性与批次差异性时显得力不从心。智能生物过程控制将传感技术、数据科学与自动化决策结合，使生物制造从&quot;经验驱动&quot;升级为&quot;数据驱动&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"过程分析技术-pat\">过程分析技术（PAT）</h3><p>PAT框架由FDA在2004年提出，核心理念是&quot;质量由设计（QbD）决定，而非由检测保障&quot;：</p>\n<p><strong>在线传感器技术</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>近红外光谱（NIR）：非侵入式实时测量底物浓度、细胞密度、产物浓度</li>\n<li>拉曼光谱：分子指纹级分辨，可同时监测葡萄糖、乳酸、氨基酸等10+组分</li>\n<li>软传感器（Soft Sensor）：基于数学模型或机器学习，从易测变量（DO、pH、OUR）推断难测变量（活细胞密度、代谢状态）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>数据采集架构</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;硬传感器(pH/DO/T/压力)&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;数据采集系统 SCADA&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;光谱传感器(NIR/Raman)&quot;] --&gt; D&#10;    C[&quot;尾气分析(MS/IR)&quot;] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;历史数据库&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;实时分析引擎&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;控制动作输出&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"硬传感器(pH/DO/T/压力)\"] --&gt; D[\"数据采集系统 SCADA\"]\n    B[\"光谱传感器(NIR/Raman)\"] --&gt; D\n    C[\"尾气分析(MS/IR)\"] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[\"历史数据库\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"实时分析引擎\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"控制动作输出\"]</pre><p><strong>多变量统计过程控制（MSPC）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PCA（主成分分析）：将高维传感器数据降维，Hotelling <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>和SPE统计量检测异常</li>\n<li>PLS（偏最小二乘）：建立光谱数据→过程变量的校准模型</li>\n</ul>\n<p>异常检测阈值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mfrac><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⇒</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>过程异常</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\frac{t_i^2}{\\lambda_i} &gt; T^2_{\\alpha} \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad \\text{过程异常}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">过程异常</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"数字孪生与模型预测控制\">数字孪生与模型预测控制</h3><p>**数字孪生（Digital Twin）**是物理生物过程的高保真虚拟镜像：</p>\n<p>构建层次：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>机理模型层</strong>：基于Monod动力学、物料衡算、传热传质方程的一阶原理模型</li>\n<li><strong>数据驱动层</strong>：神经网络/高斯过程修正机理模型的偏差（Hybrid Model）</li>\n<li><strong>实时同步层</strong>：卡尔曼滤波或粒子滤波融合传感器数据，持续校准虚拟模型状态</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>模型预测控制（MPC）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在每个控制周期，基于数字孪生预测未来<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>步过程状态</li>\n<li>求解优化问题确定最优控制序列（补料速率、搅拌转速、温度设定点）</li>\n<li>仅执行第一步动作，下一周期重新优化（滚动时域）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>MPC优化问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munder><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{u_0, ..., u_{N-1}} \\sum_{k=0}^{N-1} \\left[ (y_k - y_{ref})^T Q (y_k - y_{ref}) + \\Delta u_k^T R \\Delta u_k \\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2028em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.842em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><