class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{s.t.} \\quad x_{k+1} = f(x_k, u_k), \\quad u_{min} \\leq u_k \\leq u_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8234em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>MPC相比传统PID控制的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>处理多输入多输出（MIMO）耦合</li>\n<li>显式约束处理（如最大补料速率、溶氧下限）</li>\n<li>预测性：提前规避未来约束违反</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ai辅助发酵优化\">AI辅助发酵优化</h3><p>机器学习在发酵过程优化中的应用层次：</p>\n<p><strong>离线优化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>贝叶斯优化（Bayesian Optimization）：用高斯过程代理模型逼近响应曲面，以最少实验次数找到最优培养基配方或操作参数</li>\n<li>采集函数（如Expected Improvement）平衡探索与利用：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EI(x) = \\mathbb{E}[\\max(f(x) - f^+, 0)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0713em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>在线自适应控制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>强化学习（RL）agent直接学习补料策略——状态为当前过程变量，动作为补料泵开度</li>\n<li>已有文献报道RL agent在模拟环境中训练后零样本迁移至真实反应器，产量提升15-30%</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>故障诊断与预警</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>LSTM/Transformer时序模型学习正常批次的&quot;指纹&quot;，偏离时触发预警</li>\n<li>结合知识图谱实现根因分析——从异常信号追溯到可能的原因（如染菌、pH电极漂移、底物批次差异）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"连续制造-vs-批次制造\">连续制造 vs 批次制造</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>批次制造（Batch）</th>\n<th>连续制造（Continuous）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>操作模式</td>\n<td>装料→培养→收获→清洗</td>\n<td>稳态连续进出料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产能灵活性</td>\n<td>通过批次数调节</td>\n<td>通过运行时间调节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备利用率</td>\n<td>30-50%（含清洗）</td>\n<td>&gt;80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品质量一致性</td>\n<td>批间变异较大</td>\n<td>稳态运行质量均一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>多品种小批量</td>\n<td>大宗品种、生物药</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制复杂度</td>\n<td>成熟、监管接受度高</td>\n<td>需要PAT+数字孪生支撑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>连续制造的经济优势：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>单位成本降低</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>资本支出</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>运营成本</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{单位成本降低} \\approx 30\\%-50\\% \\quad (\\text{资本支出}+\\text{运营成本})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位成本降低</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资本支出</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">运营成本</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但连续制造对过程稳定性要求极高——任何扰动都可能导致产品不合格，因此PAT与智能控制是连续制造的必要前提。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工业案例-连续灌注培养生产抗体\">工业案例：连续灌注培养生产抗体</h3><p>典型连续灌注系统架构：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>灌注反应器（2000L）+ 细胞截留装置（ATF/TFF）</li>\n<li>连续收获 → 连续Protein A色谱 → 连续病毒灭活 → 连续精纯</li>\n<li>运行周期：60-90天</li>\n<li>体积生产力：相比Fed-batch提升5-10倍</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;灌注反应器&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;连续收获&quot;| B[&quot;Protein A色谱&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;病毒灭活&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;精纯色谱&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;UF/DF浓缩&quot;]&#10;    F[&quot;新鲜培养基&quot;] --&gt; A&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;细胞截留&quot;| A\">graph LR\n    A[\"灌注反应器\"] --&gt;|\"连续收获\"| B[\"Protein A色谱\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"病毒灭活\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"精纯色谱\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"UF/DF浓缩\"]\n    F[\"新鲜培养基\"] --&gt; A\n    A --&gt;|\"细胞截留\"| A</pre><h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年智能生物过程控制关键进展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>西门子与赛多利斯联合发布&quot;BioProcess Digital Twin&quot;商业平台——集成机理模型库、实时数据同步与MPC优化器</li>\n<li>强化学习在真实CHO培养中首次达到超越专家水平：Amgen报道RL agent管理的灌注反应器运行45天，平均滴度高于人类操作基线22%</li>\n<li>联邦学习（Federated Learning）使多个生产基地的过程数据安全共享模型训练，解决了制药行业的数据孤岛问题</li>\n<li>中国药品监管科学行动计划正式认可连续制造申报路径，为国内CMO采用连续工艺扫清监管障碍</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>解释为什么传统PID控制在生物过程中效果有限（提示：从过程非线性、时变性、大纯滞后三个特点分析）。</li>\n<li>设计一个软传感器：利用在线可测的DO、OUR、CER数据估算活细胞密度。简述建模思路与所需训练数据。</li>\n<li>数字孪生中，机理模型与数据驱动模型各自的优劣是什么？为什么混合模型（Hybrid Model）成为主流？</li>\n<li>连续制造对过程稳定性要求极高。如果灌注反应器中细胞活力突然下降5%，应如何诊断原因并采取措施？</li>\n<li>贝叶斯优化相比传统DoE（实验设计）在哪些方面更适合发酵优化？它的局限性是什么？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>智能生物过程控制代表了生物制造从&quot;经验试错&quot;到&quot;数据决策&quot;的范式转变。PAT框架提供实时过程感知能力，数字孪生建立高保真虚拟镜像用于预测与优化，MPC实现多变量约束优化控制，而AI（贝叶斯优化、强化学习）进一步提升了决策的智能程度。连续制造是终极目标形态——其经济优势与质量一致性优势显著，但必须以PAT+智能控制为技术底座。生物制造的&quot;工业4.0&quot;正是这些技术的集成体现。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"智能生物过程控制","id":"智能生物过程控制"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"过程分析技术（PAT）","id":"过程分析技术-pat"},{"level":3,"text":"数字孪生与模型预测控制","id":"数字孪生与模型预测控制"},{"level":3,"text":"AI辅助发酵优化","id":"ai辅助发酵优化"},{"level":3,"text":"连续制造 vs 批次制造","id":"连续制造-vs-批次制造"},{"level":3,"text":"工业案例：连续灌注培养生产抗体","id":"工业案例-连续灌注培养生产抗体"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生物分离工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment/bioseparation-engineering"},"next":{"title":"生物燃料与化学品","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications/biofuels-biochemicals"}}